
{%- comment -%}
Upsell block: link to merch collection filtered by artist or artwork tag.
Ensure you create a collection handle like 'artist-{{ product.vendor | handle }}-merch'
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="upsell">
  <h3>Make it yours</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/collections/artist-{{ product.vendor | handle }}-merch">Shop {{ product.vendor }} merch</a></li>
  </ul>
</div>
